    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87191" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προεκ-κρίνω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ</span>], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>anticipate a crisis,</i>
